{"channelId":"UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg","row":["Equine Physiotherapy",10,"In WinRecovery we offer physiotherapy services for animals, specially high level sport horses in all disciplines. We mainly use electrotherapy, Tecartherapy (TECAR: Transfer of electricity capacitive resistive), non invasive, painless technique using electrodes on the horse body. It speeds up the process of natural healing, working on a wide variety of injuries in all type of tissues (muscle, tendon, ligaments, joints, bones).","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:50.349Z","channelId":"UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"2f0147ac6531bca90acac986a61f9a8826adfb4fdffa4652c68e16958da0184b","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"917830898bf2b0c1a2c29f04156bfdb2095239b88b604d3b4a285a29dd8f6b1f"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":10,"raw":"10 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:50.349Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["physical therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["physical therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvQn_wanwVWOh6nNAeOIILg"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频道简介与保存的采集原文一致，命中本人／团队／服务语境；职业资质仍未核验。","keywords":["physical therapist"],"role":"organization_self_report","excerpt":"In WinRecovery we offer physiotherapy services for animals, specially high level sport horses in all disciplines. We mainly use electrotherapy, Tecartherapy (TECAR: Trans